<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- Menu style Online (ElDewrito): KEYBOARD & MOUSE, the PC's keyboard and mouse bindings and the
mouse's settings (port/linux/game/controls_menu.c, "port keys ...", the functions behind each style's
page; port/linux/include/halo_key_bindings.h, config.toml's [controls.keyboard]). online/keys/screen
stands for the Halo 3 page (h3/keys/screen, halo3/keys.xml: menu_tags.c menu_tags_online), opened from
CUSTOMIZATION's CONTROLS tab (customize.xml's KEYBOARD & MOUSE row, a PC's alone). Laid out the online
way, as CUSTOMIZATION: the header band with the title, the rows at the left with the orange bar - SHOW
(left and right: the movement, weapon or other actions' keys, or the mouse's settings), each action
with its first and second keys, the chosen one between > < -, the help under them, the buttons at
the foot. A binds (the next key or mouse button: Escape cancels, Delete clears), X clears, Y the MCC
defaults. The other widgets are named online/keyspage/..., so that only the screen stands for a
Halo 3 one. The art is this folder's own and the Halo 3 set's. -->
<menus>
